i-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M4 Pro - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nGlow intensity property under `Environment` is not visible in Compatibility renderer in the editor when glow blend mode is set to mix.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a project with Forward+ or Mobile renderer\n2. Create a scene with an Environment\n3. Enable glow and set its blend mode to Mix\n4. Change to Compatibility renderer\n5. Note that the glow intensity property is not available in the editor when it should be\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[glow-intensity-compatibility-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22502797/glow-intensity-compatibility-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110842/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110842/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"com